config I225_V
    tristate "Intel I225-V 2.5GbE Ethernet"
    default y
    help
      Native PCIe Ethernet for Intel I225-V (8086:15f3). The initial driver
      uses one polled RX/TX queue and the existing network device interface.
      Other I225 variants and I226 controllers are not matched.
